Here are some ideas for improvement:
* A command to restart the level
* List the number of undos used
* List the number of boulders (on|not on) target tiles (maybe)
* Allow vi keys and/or numpad
* Diagonal movement (similar to NetHack: if either [x+dx][y] or [x][y
